{"availableSections":["steps","citations","reviews","correspondence","targets","checking","assumptions","lineage","evidence","exposition"],"axes":{"attribution":"guide-reviews","checking":"stored-operations-only","correspondence":"manifest-reviews","explanation":"guide-reviews","proofCoverage":"unknown","sourceFreshness":"not-assessed"},"guideStatus":"available","inputBinding":"sha256:83ba38f9a375e175f6c02d2e8444d6d0dbb6aaad958b695a4ed92e76f7b741e7","limitations":["authored-order-is-not-a-derivation","reviews-are-self-attributed","declaration-dependencies-are-structural-navigation","citations-do-not-establish-priority","guide-does-not-run-checks"],"operation":"guide","pagination":{"nextCursor":"eyJiaW5kaW5nIjoic2hhMjU2OjgzYmEzOGY5YTM3NWUxNzVmNmMwMmQyZTg0NDRkNmQwZGJiNmFhYWQ5NThiNjk1YTRlZDkyZTc2ZjdiNzQxZTciLCJvZmZzZXQiOjF9.a7c0253bc5fe5c6b43d973b8dca5f985216f9980e61adf4ea86d859e583ced0d","offset":0,"omitted":8,"returned":1,"total":9},"query":{"claim":null,"limit":1,"section":"steps","target":null},"readingOrder":"authored","resultId":"poisson-fixed-epoch-exposition-20261003-r02","reuseApplicability":"not-checked","revision":"sha256:872c241d73ea74763320085ad53169636f67a92bfe18de9e24309ce9e7e2bac3","rows":[{"author":{"identity":"OpenAI Codex guide agents (field proposal and root revision)","kind":"model"},"authority":"attributed-annotation","claimId":"cor:fixed-epoch-all-horizon","claimRevision":"sha256:0108f8bad055aabc20a15fde2fed178bec5d26a78e097a8113a6d68967beea83","currency":"current","explanation":"For integers E>0 and T>E, sensitivity Δ>0, ε>0 and 0<δ<1, put a=Δ/√v_FB. The sufficient condition a² ≤ (6E/(3E+2)) ε gives v_FB < v̄_(E,T) ≤ v_(E,T), with strict full-batch total-variance dominance for every S≥0. It is a sufficient domain, not a classification outside it or an ordering of every pair of smaller batches. The target bindings cover the transcript conclusions and full-batch reference; the average-only strengthening remains conventional exposition in the supplied assessments.","id":"conditional-all-horizons","identityAuthentication":"not-assessed","position":1,"prerequisites":[],"purpose":"Start with the usable positive result.","references":{"":{"input":"guide-inputs","pointer":"/steps/0","revision":"sha256:906319c5f9a7949f246d28f38e56f76fb8d9808265dd45788f0014117b0b5bce"},"/targetBindings":{"appendPath":false,"input":"guide-inputs","pointer":"/steps/0/targetRevisions","revision":"sha256:906319c5f9a7949f246d28f38e56f76fb8d9808265dd45788f0014117b0b5bce"}},"revision":"sha256:5fea6bbf25014364a57fad29f55279ff0f0a4313fca706a2f39a1be814de2912","sources":[{"digest":"sha256:d3b6b9dceb8dc3465120abbc6c89133ad5f754eb13c4918d3a10e8cc9d28f583","locator":"latex/natural-language/poisson_fixed_epoch_large_batch_optimality_exposition.tex#cor:fixed-epoch-all-horizon"},{"digest":"sha256:d3b6b9dceb8dc3465120abbc6c89133ad5f754eb13c4918d3a10e8cc9d28f583","locator":"latex/natural-language/poisson_fixed_epoch_large_batch_optimality_exposition.tex#sec:near-full"}],"stepId":"conditional-all-horizons","targetBindings":[{"currentRevision":"sha256:f69a81bda0b91ebe0d15d22214755f0fe9ee1c975309e7a08e80f6a761502370","hypotheses":{"reason":"no-structured-hypotheses-extraction","status":"unavailable"},"references":{"/resolution":{"appendPath":false,"input":"manifest","pointer":"/targets/3","revision":"sha256:872c241d73ea74763320085ad53169636f67a92bfe18de9e24309ce9e7e2bac3"},"/source":{"input":"manifest","pointer":"/targets/3/source","revision":"sha256:872c241d73ea74763320085ad53169636f67a92bfe18de9e24309ce9e7e2bac3"},"/typeText":{"input":"manifest","pointer":"/targets/3/typeText","revision":"sha256:872c241d73ea74763320085ad53169636f67a92bfe18de9e24309ce9e7e2bac3"}},"requestedRevision":"sha256:f69a81bda0b91ebe0d15d22214755f0fe9ee1c975309e7a08e80f6a761502370","resolution":{"checking":"not-assessed","name":"Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochCalibratedPrivacyVariance_gt_fullBatch_of_epochUniformSignal","projectRevisionBasis":"producer-declared","reason":"exact-stored-s